00:15:48.031 --> 00:15:50.117
Kill them all, I say! Good riddance.

00:15:50.200 --> 00:15:52.077
Did I mention I'm not a man?

00:15:52.160 --> 00:15:54.663
I'm a Manbot.
That's an understandable mistake.

00:15:54.746 --> 00:15:56.373
You can let me down now, thanks.

00:15:56.456 --> 00:15:58.125
He big jerk like man.

00:15:58.208 --> 00:16:00.085
I sure am, but check the crotch.

00:16:01.044 --> 00:16:03.297
- Nothing.
- Very well. Release him.

00:16:03.380 --> 00:16:06.508
As for the others,
take them to the snu-snu chambers!

00:16:21.148 --> 00:16:22.858
I'll miss ya, meat bag.

00:16:22.941 --> 00:16:24.276
Me, too, meat bag.

00:16:24.359 --> 00:16:25.652
Goodbye, friends.

00:16:25.736 --> 00:16:29.031
I never thought I would die like this,
but I had always really hoped.

00:16:29.114 --> 00:16:32.492
The Amazonians
will be divided into three groups.

00:16:32.576 --> 00:16:34.077
The one called Zapp

00:16:34.161 --> 00:16:36.788
will be snu-snu'dby the large women.

00:16:36.872 --> 00:16:39.208
He that is designated Fry

00:16:39.291 --> 00:16:42.044
will be snu-snu'd by the petite women.

00:16:42.127 --> 00:16:45.506
And Kif, as the most attractive male,

00:16:45.589 --> 00:16:50.010
will be snu-snu'd
by the most beautiful women of Amazonia.

00:16:50.093 --> 00:16:52.095
Then the large women,

00:16:52.179 --> 00:16:54.348
then the petite women,

00:16:54.431 --> 00:16:56.808
then the large women again.

00:16:56.934 --> 00:16:58.810
Initiate snu-snu!

00:16:58.894 --> 00:17:01.230
Snu-snu! Snu-snu! Snu-snu!

00:17:02.564 --> 00:17:05.651
Amy! Before I die, I have to tell you,

00:17:05.734 --> 00:17:08.362
I didn't mean to say
those awful things on our date.

00:17:08.445 --> 00:17:09.988
They were all Zapp's idea.

00:17:10.072 --> 00:17:12.241
Really? Honest and true?

00:17:12.324 --> 00:17:13.325
Yes.

00:17:13.408 --> 00:17:16.995
And that person calling
and hanging up was me.

00:17:17.079 --> 00:17:19.873
I was just too nervous
to say hello because...

00:17:20.541 --> 00:17:23.001
- I love you!
- Oh, Kif!

00:17:23.085 --> 00:17:25.504
It Og's first time.

00:17:25.587 --> 00:17:26.964
Be gentle!

00:17:31.093 --> 00:17:32.427
We've got to do something.

00:17:32.511 --> 00:17:35.055
Bender, maybe you can
interface with the Femputer

00:17:35.138 --> 00:17:36.765
and reprogram it to let them go.

00:17:36.849 --> 00:17:38.767
Maybe you can interface with my ass

00:17:38.851 --> 00:17:40.227
by biting it!

00:17:42.521 --> 00:17:43.814
All right, I'll go.

00:17:52.906 --> 00:17:53.907
Whoo!

00:17:53.991 --> 00:17:56.326
- Yeah!
- Oh, baby!

00:18:02.791 --> 00:18:04.126
How Tonk look?

00:18:04.209 --> 00:18:05.460
Tonk look good.

00:18:05.544 --> 00:18:06.628
Me fat.

00:18:06.712 --> 00:18:08.714
No. You look good.

00:18:08.797 --> 00:18:09.798
Tonk fat.

00:18:17.264 --> 00:18:20.684
Intruder! Stay away from
the mighty Femputer. Guards!

00:18:20.767 --> 00:18:24.438
Time to override the CPU
and reprogram this Femputer.

00:18:26.190 --> 00:18:27.191
Hey!

00:18:27.649 --> 00:18:29.776
Stop it! Stop it! Hey, cut that out!

00:18:30.819 --> 00:18:32.404
Cease hitting Femputer.

00:18:33.405 --> 00:18:36.325
You're no Femputer. You're a Fembot!

00:18:36.950 --> 00:18:38.160
It's true.

00:18:38.243 --> 00:18:42.623
I disguised myself as a Femputer
so I could rule the Amazonians.

00:18:42.706 --> 00:18:44.750
- But why?
- Why?

00:18:45.542 --> 00:18:46.877
Why?

00:18:46.960 --> 00:18:50.214
I came here from a faraway planet,

00:18:50.297 --> 00:18:53.550
a planet ruled by a chauvinistic Manputer

00:18:53.634 --> 00:18:55.636
that was really a Manbot.

00:18:55.719 --> 00:18:59.598
Have you any idea
how it feels to be a Fembot

00:18:59.681 --> 00:19:03.435
living in a Manbot's Manputer's world?

00:19:03.519 --> 00:19:06.355
- What?
- And now, my meddling Manbot,

00:19:06.438 --> 00:19:09.107
there's the question
of what to do with you.

00:19:10.108 --> 00:19:11.735
No!

00:19:20.953 --> 00:19:22.079
We need rest.

00:19:22.162 --> 00:19:25.374
The spirit is willing,
but the flesh is spongy and bruised.

00:19:25.457 --> 00:19:27.960
It time snu-snu!

00:19:28.043 --> 00:19:29.044
Can't we just cuddle?

00:19:29.127 --> 00:19:30.546
No!

00:19:31.755 --> 00:19:33.048
We can't wait for Bender.

00:19:33.131 --> 00:19:34.967
It's time for a woman's touch.

00:19:45.060 --> 00:19:48.355
Me next snu-snu! Out me way!

00:19:50.440 --> 00:19:52.359
Where go beautiful man?

00:19:53.318 --> 00:19:55.070
Me want snu-snu!

00:20:00.033 --> 00:20:02.119
Kif, jump!

00:20:03.120 --> 00:20:04.538
My hero.

00:20:07.457 --> 00:20:09.710
Me not get snu-snu!

00:20:09.793 --> 00:20:10.794
Get him!

00:20:27.644 --> 00:20:31.648
Mighty Femputer,
small girl steal green kissy man.

00:20:31.732 --> 00:20:32.941
We kill her now?

00:20:33.025 --> 00:20:35.527
Come back later. Leave me alone.

00:20:35.611 --> 00:20:36.987
Yeah. Get lost!

00:20:41.533 --> 00:20:42.784
Ooh!

00:20:42.868 --> 00:20:45.204
I'm a scary Femputer!

00:20:45.287 --> 00:20:47.414
Release the prisoners!

00:20:47.998 --> 00:20:50.626
And bring gold! Lots of gold!

00:20:50.709 --> 00:20:53.378
Gold? Why Femputer want gold?

00:20:53.462 --> 00:20:54.880
You heard the man!

00:20:55.005 --> 00:20:56.006
Yeah.

00:20:58.300 --> 00:21:00.177
Yeah, baby. Come on, give me some of that.

00:21:02.262 --> 00:21:05.140
And that's how I got my new shell.

00:21:05.224 --> 00:21:08.060
It looks just like the shell
I threw out yesterday,

00:21:08.143 --> 00:21:10.187
and I found it in the same dumpster.

00:21:10.270 --> 00:21:12.814
But this one had a live raccoon inside.

00:21:13.023 --> 00:21:15.609
Pretty good story, hey, Hermes?

00:21:15.692 --> 00:21:18.695
Stick to someone else, ya windy barnacle!

00:21:19.404 --> 00:21:22.366
It's funny how the battle
of the sexes was only resolved

00:21:22.449 --> 00:21:25.452
when a Manbot and a Fembot
realized they loved each other.

00:21:25.536 --> 00:21:27.079
Yeah.

00:21:27.162 --> 00:21:29.414
By the way, if she calls, I'm not here.

00:21:29.498 --> 00:21:33.502
All I know is this gold says
that was the best mission ever.

00:21:35.254 --> 00:21:36.547
It sure was.

00:21:36.630 --> 00:21:40.467
- Oh, yeah.
- I had snu-snu.

00:21:40.551 --> 00:21:43.095
So, Amy,

00:21:43.178 --> 00:21:44.763
what do you wanna do now?